<title>FRANCE: EU CUTS MEDIUM WHEAT TARIFF TO 30.71 ECUS.</title>
<headline>EU CUTS MEDIUM WHEAT TARIFF TO 30.71 ECUS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission cut the import duty on medium-quality wheat from distant origins to 30.71 Ecus per tonne effective Friday, officials said.</p>
<p>The cut was from a previous tariff of 36.44 Ecus per tonne.</p>
<p>The duty for imports from nearby origins was as usual set 10 Ecus per tonne higher at 40.71 Ecus.</p>
<p>Data used by the Commission to calculate the tariffs (usually found on GREF) was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
